**/.git
.github
.docker
.manyforge
.manyforge-dev
.manyforge-diagnostic
.manyforge-var
qualification
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/install
**/log
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
docs
exts
